      "id": "claim_d8f5863ab050493483e0f4f76a03bff0",
      "statement": "The `agentforge eval` Typer command (src/agentforge/cli/main.py) loads `cases` from a YAML dataset, runs each case through `AgentRuntime.run`, and writes one JSONL line per case to `agents/<id>/eval_runs/<UTC %Y%m%d-%H%M%S>.jsonl` with case, input, output, notes, latency_ms, timestamp, and ok fields; a provider error on an individual case writes ok:false and continues.",
